<title>FRANCE: Algeria buys 30,000 tonnes maize - traders.</title>
<headline>Algeria buys 30,000 tonnes maize - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria has bought 30,000 tonnes of maize at around $150 per tonne, including cost and freight, for shipment in February, European grain traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The maize is likely to come from the United States, they said.</p>
<p>Algeria was in the market for 30,000 tonnes of U.S. or Argentine maize.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
